10:46:34 #************************************************************
10:46:34 #*                     MadGraph5_aMC@NLO                    *
10:46:34 #*                                                          *
10:46:34 #*                *                       *                 *
10:46:34 #*                  *        * *        *                   *
10:46:34 #*                    * * * * 5 * * * *                     *
